From 59c71ecc0219d0ff98467b0bafa04e4c386a685d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ignaciopd3 <210892957+ignaciopd3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:01:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/24] VPN pill opens the app whose VPN is up: vpn_app_per_app
 for a per-app VPN

Android does not tell Home whose VPN is up, only whether it covers Home. A per-app VPN
(a streaming app's built-in WARP that only carries that app) leaves Home out, so the pill
opens vpn_app_per_app then and vpn_app otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../main/java/com/gathin/tvhome/Config.java   |  9 +++++--
 .../java/com/gathin/tvhome/MainActivity.java  | 25 +++++++++++++++----
 .../main/java/com/gathin/tvhome/VpnBadge.java |  8 ++++++
 launcher/app/src/main/res/values/config.xml   |  4 +++
 .../java/com/gathin/tvhome/VpnPillTest.java   | 11 ++++++++
 5 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

